OL,3,GNEWSARail services to change after heat
OL,4,Aaffects track
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthern Rail has announced changes to
OL,7,Fsome of its services in West Sussex
OL,8,Fnext month after prolonged hot and dry
OL,9,Fweather "affected track conditions".
OL,11,FThe company said temporary speed
OL,12,Frestrictions will be in place on the
OL,13,FArun Valley route between Horsham and
OL,14,FBarnham from 1 September, meaning more
OL,15,Ftime will be needed for the completion
OL,16,Fof journeys.
OL,18,FAs a result, fewer trains will be able
OL,19,Fto operate because "running the normal
OL,20,Ftimetable could lead to delays building
OL,21,Fthroughout the day and increase the
OL,22,Frisk of short notice cancellations".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
